    "description": "Voxa Workflow 3 — fires when ElevenLabs sends a post_call_transcription webhook. Responds 200 immediately, then in parallel: computes minutes, fires Stripe meter event (value as STRING of whole int, identifier=conversation_id_meter for idempotency), asks Claude Opus 4.7 to extract structured lead data, upserts calls + meter_events + leads, and WhatsApps the owner if lead_score>=7 OR sentiment='angry'."
